---
description: Custom hook conventions (naming, exhaustive deps)
globs: src/hooks/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

Full rule: see `AGENTS.md` § Naming Conventions and § Data & State.

- camelCase with a `use` prefix (`useDebouncedValue.ts`).
- Exhaustive `useEffect`/`useCallback` dependency arrays (ESLint-enforced).
- Generic hooks only live here; feature-specific hooks live inside the feature folder.
- Server-state fetching belongs in a TanStack Query hook, never a raw `useEffect` fetch.
